    comment "en" """
        Source X3228 = Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension of X32 SNOMED CT 218201004 (Athena ICD10
        concept 45756391), refined by Swedish external-cause metadata: place=skola, annan institution
        och offentlig lokal (school, other institution and public area); activity=andra specificerade
        aktiviteter (other specified activities). The clinical event/exposure is unchanged; the Swedish
        place/activity qualifiers are external-cause metadata with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4317932 = sctid 218201004. Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps
        base X32 (concept_id 45756391) -> 4317932 (relationship 45756391, 4317932); it is the
        authoritative standard concept for X32 and fully subsumes every place/activity-specific SE
        subdivision. mapping_type=broader (target fully contains every clinical meaning of the source;
        the dropped qualifier is breadth-neutral external-cause metadata, not a partial slice).
        Confidence (high): verified Athena crosswalk on the base code with a small, well-understood
        one-level breadth mismatch (the SE place/activity refinement is lost). Athena-local research
        only.
        """
}
